    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/8c/Ream_Dream_Painter_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20251228172249\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Ream Dream Painter Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/8/8c/Ream_Dream_Painter_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20251228172249\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"987\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Ream Dream Painter Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Ream_Dream_Painter_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>梦想画师</b>\n</p><p>一位携带大型画笔法杖的美丽战士。她用魔法墨水绘制的作品能活起来并战斗。她充满好奇心，周游世界寻找从未见过的颜色。 \n \n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/d4/Ream_Dream_Painter_S_Queens_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20251228172248\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Ream Dream Painter S Queens Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/d4/Ream_Dream_Painter_S_Queens_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20251228172248\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"998\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Ream Dream Painter S Queens Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Ream_Dream_Painter_S_Queens_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260821132204\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.006 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 by